  ('matagrano-sf', '3922983', 2, 'New door', '★★★', null, 'Healthy Spirits — Cortland Ave', 'Matagrano', 'Bernal Hts / Castro', null, 'Healthy Spirits'' Bernal Heights location serves the Castro, Noe Valley, and Bernal corridor. Same buyer profile as Valencia — tastemakers, craft-loyal, brand-story driven. Zero system sales. Two Healthy Spirits doors opened simultaneously is a statement for the brand.', null, null, 'New door', null),
